  "sport": "floorball",
  "title": "Ball tag – protect your ball",
  "description": "A box of about 10 × 10 metres and four players. Three have a ball each and protect it, the fourth is the chaser without a ball. The chaser tries to win a ball within the floorball rules. Whoever loses their ball becomes the new chaser and tries to win a ball from someone else.\n\nKeep it going for about five minutes. With more players: make more boxes, or have two chasers in a bigger box. The diagram is not to scale.",
  "coachingPoints": [
    {
      "id": "cp1",
      "text": "Put your body between the chaser and the ball."
    },
    {
      "id": "cp2",
      "text": "Look up – where can you carry the ball away from the chaser?"
    },
    {
      "id": "cp3",
      "text": "Chaser: win the ball with the stick, not the body."
    }
  ],
